{"id":"wb-6-363","name":"北义城玉皇庙","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"北义城玉皇庙","text":"北义城玉皇庙位于中国山西省泽州县北义城镇北义城村，2006年被列为第六批全国重点文物保护单位。\n北义城玉皇庙始建年代不详，重修于北宋大观四年（1110年），现存玉皇殿、献殿、耳殿、东西配殿、舞楼、厢房等建筑，其中玉皇殿（正殿）为宋代原构，余为后世所建。玉皇殿面阔进深各三间，单檐歇山顶，檐下斗栱为四铺作出单抄，梁架结构为三椽栿对前札牵通檐用三柱。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%8C%97%E4%B9%89%E5%9F%8E%E7%8E%89%E7%9A%87%E5%BA%99","revisionId":89061163,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=89061163","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/842232c23a64de98d2c8531d.jpg","title":"20250906_Yuhuang_Temple,_Beiyicheng_01.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:20250906_Yuhuang_Temple,_Beiyicheng_01.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/7/71/20250906_Yuhuang_Temple%2C_Beiyicheng_01.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Windmemories","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​北义城玉皇庙","width":320,"height":213}}